title: ploppin_race
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "Indulging Desires">>
You wander into a bustling tavern, where a raucous crowd has gathered around a makeshift track.
Laughter and shouts fill the air as blue, squishy creatures bounce around.
As you approach, you realize they are gambling...
With Ploppins?!
<<jump ploppin_race_choice>>
===

title: ploppin_race_choice
---
-> Take part in the gamble #paneldetails=Lose_250_Gold._60%_chance_to_gain_500_Gold.
    <<if gold() >= 250>>
        <<change_gold -250>>
        <<jump ploppin_race_gamble>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump ploppin_race_broke>>
    <<endif>>
-> I don't partake in such vices #paneldetails=Gain_6_Light
    <<change_light 6>>
    This is an utter waste of your time. You set off on your journey once again.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: ploppin_race_gamble
---
You place your wager on a Ploppin and join the crowd around the track.
The Ploppins rush forward as the spectators shout encouragement for their chosen racers!
<<if chance(60)>>
    [green]Your chosen Ploppin pulls ahead at the last moment and crosses the finish line first![/green]
    You happily cheer as your winning wager is paid out.
    <<change_gold 500>>
    You collect your winnings with a big grin.
<<else>>
    [red]Your chosen Ploppin stumbles at the final obstacle and loses the race.[/red]
    You groan as your wager disappears into the unknown...
<<endif>>
After the race, another group of Ploppins is brought to the starting line.
-> More! #paneldetails=Lose_250_Gold._60%_chance_to_gain_500_Gold._-3_Light.
    <<if gold() >= 250>>
        <<change_gold -250>>
        <<change_light -3>>
        <<jump ploppin_race_gamble>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump ploppin_race_broke>>
    <<endif>>
-> That's enough...
    A wise general knows when not to push their luck. You leave the venue.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: ploppin_race_broke
---
You look over your empty coin pouch and sigh...
-> Leave
    Feeling ashamed, you step away from the crowd.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===
